%% Estados de una toma (D37, A1). El estado solo avanza.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> requested
    requested --> camera_starting
    camera_starting --> recording_confirmed: la GoPro reporta que graba (regla 2)
    recording_confirmed --> moving: el robot ejecuta la primitiva (D2)
    moving --> finishing
    finishing --> rendering: la cámara se detiene
    rendering --> done
    requested --> aborted: el operador cancela
    camera_starting --> aborted
    recording_confirmed --> aborted
    camera_starting --> failed: sin confirmación a tiempo
    recording_confirmed --> failed
    moving --> failed: error del robot, sin reintento
    finishing --> failed
    rendering --> failed
    done --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    aborted --> [*]
